  "src/Templates/Boilerplate/Bit.Boilerplate/.docs/01- Entity Framework Core.md": [
    "`bit migration` runs EF Core's `dotnet ef` with the `dotnet-ef` version that matches the project's EF Core packages, formats the new migration with `dotnet format`, and when it fails, shows its errors and the command to run it again. Install the bit CLI with `dotnet tool install --global Bit.Cli --version {V}`, or run it without installing it: `dnx Bit.Cli --version {V} -- migration add Initial`."
  ],
  "src/Templates/Boilerplate/Bit.Boilerplate/.docs/05- Localization and Multi-language Support.md": [
    "Nothing to install: `dnx Bit.Cli --version {V} -- translate` runs it straight from NuGet. With the bit CLI installed as a .NET global tool (`dotnet tool install --global Bit.Cli --version {V}`), the command is `bit translate`."
  ],
